WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.440
One ancient prophet pictures
swords beaten into ploughshares.

2
00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:09.200
Another prophet reverses it: beat
your ploughshares into swords.

3
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.680
Both lines come from the same scriptures,

4
00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:14.420
read by Jews and Christians alike.

5
00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:16.910
So can a war be holy?

6
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.370
What do sacred texts
really say about fighting?

7
00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.750
In this mission, you'll trace
war through the Old Testament,

8
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.880
from a victory song to a vision of peace.

9
00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:30.620
Then you'll test the
Crusades, which began in 1095,

10
00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:34.280
and today's claims of holy
war, against the texts.

11
00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:37.520
Your mission: find out
whether, for believers,

12
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.390
a war can ever be holy.
